{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** `PluginRunner` previously documented and implemented registration-order dispatch for every hook. Reversing `onInvocationEnd` changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations and can invert established flush or cleanup dependencies. Retain registration order, or introduce an explicit opt-in LIFO scope mechanism for plugins that require reverse unwinding.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77NvFW","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"2e3e001e3a3bcd102985225004c7088f9aadb411c5da205feb7c75955b058666","observation_id":"aro_v1_fy7aahr2hpgrakmfejiajryir6","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T04:31:02Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gznuwbdoezgdubsa2zuhlunkko","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"880c672b694dd6e9859596872447c03fb779d522","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_7twmpj2ctdx7lopf7zxhy42bgl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T04:31:02Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
